Z||000006||bHooper||03-31-2001||10:45 AM||||the price for living in paradise, is not owning a fiero!!||||reg||1
Z||000007||TwisT||03-31-2001||12:37 PM||||...I wouldn't be going if it wasn't for this beautiful woman:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallkat.JPG"> <P>We met in a chat room about a year and a half ago and the rest is history!  Her name is Kat...  she's lived in St. Martin all of her life.  I won't get into mushy details (hey,  remember,  this is a FIERO forum!) but I will tell you that she's the "one."  <P>...And I just realized that none of you have ever seen my face:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/march7.jpg"> <P>Goofy lookin' bastard,  eh?  LOL...<P>Yes,  I'm going to LIVE there.  You have to understand that the Carribean is a COMPLETELY different lifestyle than here in the U.S.  Living there means being void of all material things and living on the basics.  Not everyone is cut out for it,  beleive it or not.  You have to be willing to give up EVERYTHING you know and have.  Vaccationing there is one thing;  living there is another!<P>I will be taking scuba diving lessons next month to get certified.  Right now I would like to get into the tourism aspect of the Islands,  being a certified scuba instructor and/or dive guide for tourists in the reefs.  <P>It's tough work,  but somebody's got to do it...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Like I said,  out of all the things I'm going to miss,  I will miss Fieros and the people that own them the most.<P>Brett<P>  ||||reg||1
Z||000008||TheFiero64||03-31-2001||02:10 PM||||Sorry to see you go. Best of luck over there.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
Z||000009||TwisT||03-31-2001||02:23 PM||||Hmmm...<P>Fiero or Carribean?  Fiero or Carribean?  Fiero or Carribean????  LOL...  <P>Who knows...  maybe all the tropical weather,  miles of white-sandy beaches,  coral-reef diving,  marguarita-sipping,  Red Stripe and Corona gulping,  raggae-music listening will be too much for me to handle.  <P>Maybe not...  LOL...<P>GTBastard...  bummer we never got to hang!  I was looking forward to stomping around with you on the streets of South Dakota!  Keep 'em in line...<P>Hoop...  kinda' ironic,  isn't it?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Tell you the truth...  my Fiero WAS my center of life up until now.  Maybe I don't have a life,  I don't know!  LOL...  Anyway,  when you get the Fiero bug,  it runs deep in your veins.<P>I will stop in here from time to time to bug you guys.  I'll let you know how high the waves are and how the good the food is...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Brett||||reg||1
Z||000010||bHooper||03-31-2001||06:15 PM||||nice looking photo, of the chick... but the other one is a bit goofy!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>so, one question, and an important question... have you met her in person, yet?.. or at least seen some streaming video of her?<P>reason i ask, haveing been through this internet dating thing b4... ya gotta be carefull... in other words, i could show you a really beautifull photo of my GT... taken in 1991.  does that mean the car still looks that good?  or does that mean that it is a photo of my car?<P>just be carefull... cover all your bases, and best of luck!<P>hoop<P>||||reg||1
Z||000011||FieroFanaticus2||03-31-2001||06:29 PM||||No woman is worth giving up your love and passions in life.  Just my input.  ||||reg||1
Z||000012||TwisT||03-31-2001||06:52 PM||||Hoop,<P>Kat and I have known each other for a year and a half now and have been together four times.  The rest speaks for itself!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>FieroFanaticus2,  there's more to life than Fieros,  believe it or not.  It's a small sacrifice to make for a lifestyle and environment which most people only dream of.  <P>Brett||||reg||1
Z||000013||DaRkLoRD||03-31-2001||07:37 PM||||best of luck.. sometimes I wish I could get away from everything here.. but only for a vacation..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>keep in touch with the forum!<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||14
